This file contains a list of the games that are stored in the
comp.sources.games archives.  If your archive site (e.g. uunet)
saves sources in subdirectories based on the volume number, then you'll
have to look at the index file in each subdir to find where the source
is.  (In my case, everything is in one directory.)  Also, on some sites
the naming convention may be slightly different (e.g uunet uses "partxx"
rather than "Partxx").  The source is also compressed on most sites, so
don't forget the '.Z' suffix when requesting files.

